<slide xmlns="https://www.larkoffice.com/sml/2.0"><style><fill><fillColor color="rgb(250,248,243)"/></fill></style><data><shape type="text" topLeftX="54" topLeftY="34" width="500" height="18"><content textType="body" fontSize="11" color="rgb(74,127,165)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="思源黑体" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="1" bold="true"><p>03  我们的价值</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="54" topLeftY="54" width="720" height="36"><content textType="body" fontSize="23" color="rgb(43,47,54)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="思源黑体" lineSpacing="multiple:1.1" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="0" bold="true" wrap="false"><p>能力四 · 实验层：设计能证伪自己的实验，把失败沉淀成制度</p></content></shape><shape type="rect" topLeftX="54" topLeftY="96" width="36" height="3"><fill><fillColor color="rgb(217,150,46)"/></fill></shape><shape type="rect" topLeftX="92" topLeftY="97" width="814" height="1"><fill><fillColor color="rgb(220,224,228)"/></fill></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="54" topLeftY="516" width="420" height="16"><content textType="body" fontSize="9" color="rgb(150,162,172)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="思源黑体" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="0"><p>Nivis · 基于大语言模型的代码安全分析系统</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="840" topLeftY="516" width="66" height="16"><content textType="body" fontSize="9" color="rgb(150,162,172)" textAlign="right" fontFamily="Roboto Mono" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="0"><p>14 / 30</p></content></shape><shape type="rect" topLeftX="54" topLeftY="118" width="4" height="18"><fill><fillColor color="rgb(52,94,128)"/></fill></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="66" topLeftY="118" width="380" height="20"><content textType="body" fontSize="13.5" color="rgb(43,47,54)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="思源黑体" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="0" bold="true"><p>方法 · 我们会什么</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="54" topLeftY="148" width="30" height="22"><content textType="body" fontSize="14" color="rgb(52,94,128)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="Roboto Mono" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="0" bold="true"><p>01</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="90" topLeftY="149" width="380" height="16"><content textType="body" fontSize="12" color="rgb(43,47,54)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="思源黑体" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="0" bold="true"><p>双口径测量</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="90" topLeftY="168" width="384" height="44"><content textType="body" fontSize="10" color="rgb(91,103,112)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="思源黑体" lineSpacing="multiple:1.45" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="0"><p>loose/strict 双严格度 + micro/macro/风险加权分；未决率与准确率成对呈现，单一指标不许报喜。</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="54" topLeftY="222" width="30" height="22"><content textType="body" fontSize="14" color="rgb(52,94,128)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="Roboto Mono" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="0" bold="true"><p>02</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="90" topLeftY="223" width="380" height="16"><content textType="body" fontSize="12" color="rgb(43,47,54)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="思源黑体" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="0" bold="true"><p>测量与自举隔离</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="90" topLeftY="242" width="384" height="44"><content textType="body" fontSize="10" color="rgb(91,103,112)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="思源黑体" lineSpacing="multiple:1.45" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="0"><p>--no-signal-feedback 干净评估、共形预测用独立校准集、冻结集只读，测量动作不参与被测对象。</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="54" topLeftY="296" width="30" height="22"><content textType="body" fontSize="14" color="rgb(52,94,128)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="Roboto Mono" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="0" bold="true"><p>03</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="90" topLeftY="297" width="380" height="16"><content textType="body" fontSize="12" color="rgb(43,47,54)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="思源黑体" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="0" bold="true"><p>归因分流记账</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="90" topLeftY="316" width="384" height="44"><content textType="body" fontSize="10" color="rgb(91,103,112)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="思源黑体" lineSpacing="multiple:1.45" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="0"><p>no_candidate（工具欠召回）与 rejected（模型误否决）分开记账，优化永远打在正确的位置。</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="54" topLeftY="370" width="30" height="22"><content textType="body" fontSize="14" color="rgb(52,94,128)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="Roboto Mono" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="0" bold="true"><p>04</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="90" topLeftY="371" width="380" height="16"><content textType="body" fontSize="12" color="rgb(43,47,54)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="思源黑体" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="0" bold="true"><p>可复现优先</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="90" topLeftY="390" width="384" height="44"><content textType="body" fontSize="10" color="rgb(91,103,112)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="思源黑体" lineSpacing="multiple:1.45" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="0"><p>score_batch.py 一键复算、N=3 采样 + Bootstrap 置信区间、答案与权重全部版本冻结。</p></content></shape><shape type="rect" topLeftX="496" topLeftY="118" width="4" height="18"><fill><fillColor color="rgb(111,163,155)"/></fill></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="508" topLeftY="118" width="400" height="20"><content textType="body" fontSize="13.5" color="rgb(43,47,54)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="思源黑体" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="0" bold="true"><p>应对 · 这些方法解决过什么</p></content></shape><shape type="round-rect" topLeftX="496" topLeftY="148" width="410" height="88" presetHandlers="8"><fill><fillColor color="rgb(244,247,250)"/></fill></shape><shape type="round-rect" topLeftX="496" topLeftY="148" width="4" height="88" presetHandlers="2"><fill><fillColor color="rgb(111,163,155)"/></fill></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="514" topLeftY="158" width="380" height="16"><content textType="body" fontSize="11.5" color="rgb(43,47,54)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="思源黑体" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="0" bold="true"><p>fixed3 → fixed5：重建测量本身</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="514" topLeftY="180" width="378" height="52"><content textType="body" fontSize="10" color="rgb(91,103,112)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="思源黑体" lineSpacing="multiple:1.5" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="0"><p>同模型、同数据只换评估方式：0.982/0.167 → 1.000/0.043，污染源正是测量过程。</p></content></shape><shape type="round-rect" topLeftX="496" topLeftY="248" width="410" height="88" presetHandlers="8"><fill><fillColor color="rgb(244,247,250)"/></fill></shape><shape type="round-rect" topLeftX="496" topLeftY="248" width="4" height="88" presetHandlers="2"><fill><fillColor color="rgb(111,163,155)"/></fill></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="514" topLeftY="258" width="380" height="16"><content textType="body" fontSize="11.5" color="rgb(43,47,54)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="思源黑体" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="0" bold="true"><p>提示五维审计：把“不好”拆成可修项</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="514" topLeftY="280" width="378" height="52"><content textType="body" fontSize="10" color="rgb(91,103,112)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="思源黑体" lineSpacing="multiple:1.5" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="0"><p>覆盖度 59.0%、到点率 86.1%、14.3% 类别缺专用规则，逐项有主、逐项可修。</p></content></shape><shape type="round-rect" topLeftX="496" topLeftY="348" width="410" height="88" presetHandlers="8"><fill><fillColor color="rgb(244,247,250)"/></fill></shape><shape type="round-rect" topLeftX="496" topLeftY="348" width="4" height="88" presetHandlers="2"><fill><fillColor color="rgb(111,163,155)"/></fill></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="514" topLeftY="358" width="380" height="16"><content textType="body" fontSize="11.5" color="rgb(43,47,54)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="思源黑体" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="0" bold="true"><p>失败沉淀为制度</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="514" topLeftY="380" width="378" height="52"><content textType="body" fontSize="10" color="rgb(91,103,112)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="思源黑体" lineSpacing="multiple:1.5" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="0"><p>26 类错误清单 + 15 个审计版本：每次踩坑都变成下一轮的强制检查项，不重复交学费。</p></content></shape><shape type="round-rect" topLeftX="54" topLeftY="448" width="852" height="58" presetHandlers="8"><fill><fillColor color="rgb(31,46,56)"/></fill></shape><shape type="round-rect" topLeftX="54" topLeftY="448" width="4" height="58" presetHandlers="2"><fill><fillColor color="rgb(217,150,46)"/></fill></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="78" topLeftY="458" width="400" height="14"><content textType="body" fontSize="9" color="rgb(217,150,46)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="Roboto Mono" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="1" bold="true"><p>CORE PRINCIPLE</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="78" topLeftY="475" width="812" height="28"><content textType="body" fontSize="12.5" color="rgb(255,255,255)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="思源黑体" lineSpacing="multiple:1.4" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="0" bold="true"><p>实验的目的不是证明自己对，而是尽快、低成本地证明自己哪里不对。</p></content></shape></data><note><content textType="body" fontSize="12"><p>第四层是实验能力。第一，双口径：宽松和严格两个严格度，micro、macro、风险加权分三套分数，未决率必须和准确率成对出现，防止单一指标报喜。第二，测量和训练物理隔离，干净评估默认关闭信号反馈，共形校准必须用独立数据集。第三，归因分流，工具没召回和模型误否决分开记账。第四，一切可复现，score_batch 一键复算。右边三个案例：fixed3 到 fixed5 证明问题出在测量本身；五维审计把模糊的提示不好拆成可修项；26 类错误清单让每次失败都变成制度。</p></content></note></slide>